                    <li><a href="#registration" style="color: #500a2f; text-decoration: none;">• Registration Process</a></li>
                    <li><a href="#contact-details" style="color: #500a2f; text-decoration: none;">• Contact Details</a></li>
                </ul><div><span style="font-size: 21.6px;"><br></span></div>
            </div>
