                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-dark position-absolute bottom-0 end-0 m-2 p-0 rounded-circle editor-img-btn" style="width: 26px; height: 26px; font-size: 11px; line-height: 26px;" onclick="openAvatarModal(this)" title="Change Photo">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-camera"></i></button></div></div><div class="col-lg-8 col-md-7 dbim-iwt-text-col"><h3 class="fw-bold mb-2" contenteditable="true" style="color: #1e1b24; font-size: 2.1rem; line-height: 1.3;"><span style="color: rgb(80, 10, 47); font-size: 38.4px;">Handloom Mark &amp; Logo</span></h3>
                                <p class="lead text-secondary mb-3" contenteditable="true" style="font-size: 1.35rem; line-height: 1.65; color: #4b5563;"><span style="color: rgb(30, 41, 59); font-size: 16px;"><span style="font-family: &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; color: rgb(30, 41, 59); text-decoration: none; line-height: 24px;">Handloom Mark logo was developed by the NID, indicates interlocking of warp and weft yarn symbolising the collaborative institutes giving their inputs and artisans giving their skill. The Handloom Mark and logo has been registered as Certification Trade Mark under the Trade Mark Act 1999 and therefore restricted to be used only by registered users.</span></span></p></div></div></div><div class="dbim-image-with-text-wrapper my-4 p-4 border rounded shadow-sm bg-white position-relative" data-component="dbim_image_with_text" style="border-color: #ebd0de !important; border-radius: 12px;"><div class="editor-img-ctrl d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 pb-3 mb-3 border-bottom" style="font-size: 11.5px;">
